  "solution": "Logic : [(((1st)Numerator times 4+ 3)/((1st)Denominator times 4 + 3 ))=(((2nd)Numerator )/((2nd)Denominator))]\n\nGiven :\n\n \n• [((7)/(9)),((31)/(39))]\n\n⇒[((7 times 4+ 3)/(9 times 4 + 3 ))=((31)/(39))]\n\n⇒[((28+ 3)/(36 + 3 ))=((31)/(39))]\n\n⇒[((31)/(39 ))=((31)/(39))](LHS = RHS)\n\n30 = 30 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• [((3)/(5)),((15)/(23))]\n\n⇒ [((3 times 4+ 3)/(5 times 4 + 3 ))=((15)/(23))]\n\n⇒ [((12+ 3)/(20 + 3 ))=((15)/(23))]\n\n⇒ [((15)/(23 ))=((15)/(23))](LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, \n\n \n• Option - (1) : [((11)/(13)),((47)/(55))]\n\n⇒ [((11 times 4+ 3)/(13 times 4 + 3 ))=((47)/(55))]\n\n⇒ [((44+ 3)/(52 + 3 ))=((47)/(55))]\n\n⇒ [((47)/(55 ))=((47)/(55))](LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : [((9)/(13)),((37)/(55))]\n\n⇒ [((9 times 4+ 3)/(13 times 4 + 3 ))=((37)/(55))]\n\n⇒ [((36+ 3)/(52 + 3 ))=((37)/(55))]\n\n⇒ [((39)/(55 ))=((37)/(55))](LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : [((9)/(11)),((32)/(37))]\n\n⇒ [((9 times 4+ 3)/(11 times 4 + 3 ))=((32)/(37))]\n\n⇒ [((36+ 3)/(44 + 3 ))=((32)/(37))]\n\n⇒ [((39)/(47))=((32)/(37))](LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : [((17)/(19)),((36)/(77))]\n\n⇒ [((17 times 4+ 3)/(19 times 4 + 3 ))=((36)/(77))]\n\n⇒ [((68+ 3)/(76 + 3 ))=((36)/(77))]\n\n⇒ [((71)/(79))=((36)/(77))](LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
